{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】立法會交通事務委員會今日(11月20)開會討論三條過海隧道及大欖隧道分時段收費成效檢討。另外，政務司司長陳國基主持北角社區客廳開幕典禮，勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡將一同主禮。</p><p>採訪日誌｜立法會交通事務委員會檢討隧道分時段收費成效／北角社區客廳開幕</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T00:04:22.928739+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:39:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T23:57:52.222850+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T23:57:52.222850+00:00","content_hash":"5dbfaf89f14352d8256a757db4ea1039122d47b3b427dd86ae2801d7f355e6db","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}